<div id="page-peripheral" class="page">
  <h2 class="page-title">Périphériques</h2>
  <p class="lead">Augmente le polling rate et améliore la latence d'entrée de votre périphérique.</p>

  <div class="coc-widget coc-tone-default" id="controllerOverclockerWidget">
    <div class="coc-header">
      <div class="coc-header-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#9889;</div>
      <div class="coc-header-text">
        <div class="coc-title">Controller Overclocker</div>
        <div class="coc-subtitle">Réduit l'input lag en overclockant le polling USB</div>
      </div>
      <button class="coc-refresh-btn" type="button" id="btnControllerOverclockerRefresh" onclick="refreshUsbControllers()" title="Rafraîchir périphériques">&#8635;</button>
    </div>
    <div id="controllerOverclockerEmpty" class="coc-empty-hint coc-hidden">Aucune manette détectée. Branchez une manette USB puis rafraîchissez.</div>
    <div id="controllerOverclockerCards" class="coc-cards" aria-live="polite"></div>
    <div class="coc-panel-legacy" aria-hidden="true">
      <select id="controllerOverclockerSelect" class="coc-select" aria-label="Manette"></select>
      <div id="cocDeviceLine"></div>
      <div id="cocStateLine"></div>
      <span id="controllerOverclockerDeviceBadge"></span>
      <span id="cocStatusBadge"></span>
      <span id="cocPollingRate"></span>
      <span id="cocMaxRate"></span>
      <span id="cocEtatLabel"></span>
      <span id="cocResponseTime"></span>
      <span id="cocPotential"></span>
      <button type="button" id="btnBoostControllerMax" onclick="applySelectedControllerMaxRate()"></button>
      <button type="button" id="btnControllerRestoreDefault" onclick="restoreControllerPollingDefault()"></button>
    </div>
    <div id="controllerOverclockerLogBox" class="coc-hidden" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <span id="controllerOverclockerHidusbfBadge" class="coc-hidden" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <div id="controllerOverclockerAssistedGuide" class="coc-hidden" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div id="controllerOverclockerStatus" class="coc-hidden" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top:18px;">
    <div class="kicker">Overclock périphériques (manuel)</div>
    <div class="toolbar" style="margin-top:14px;">
      <button class="btn" type="button" onclick="downloadOrLaunchHidusbf()">Overclock périphérique (SETUP Bureau)</button>
    </div>
    <div class="logs" id="hidusbfLogBox" style="display:none;"></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="page-drivers" class="page">
  <h2 class="page-title">Drivers</h2>
  <p class="lead">Pilotes GPU, chipset et audio   gestion DDU et maintenance pilote.</p>
  <div class="neon-panel" style="margin-top:14px;"><div class="neon-inner">
    <div class="kicker">Maintenance GPU</div>
    <p id="driversWorkflowGuide" class="drivers-workflow-guide">0tape 1 : nettoyer le pilote GPU</p>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <strong>Display Driver Uninstaller</strong>
        <span class="card-desc">DDU permet de désinstaller proprement les pilotes graphiques.</span>
        <div class="tcp-badge tcp-badge--progress" id="dduStatusBadge" style="margin-top:10px;">Vérification...</div>
        <div id="dduStatus" class="tool-status tool-status--info" style="display:none;" aria-hidden="true">Vérification DDU...</div>
        <div class="toolbar ddu-card-actions" style="margin-top:14px;">
          <button class="btn btn-primary" type="button" id="btnDduOpenDownload" onclick="downloadOrOpenDdu()" disabled>Vérification...</button>
          <button class="btn secondary" type="button" id="btnDduAutoClean" onclick="dduAutoCleanExperimental()">Nettoyage GPU automatique</button>
        </div>
        <div class="nv-opt-progress-wrap drivers-progress-wrap" id="dduAutoProgressWrap" style="display:none;">
          <div class="nv-opt-progress-bar">
            <div class="nv-opt-progress-fill" id="dduAutoProgressFill" style="width:0%;"></div>
            <span class="nv-opt-progress-text" id="dduAutoProgressText">0 %</span>
          </div>
          <div class="nv-opt-progress-step" id="dduAutoProgressStep">0tape en cours : En attente</div>
        </div>
        <div id="dduAutoStatus" class="tool-status" style="display:none;margin-top:8px;"></div>
        <button class="btn secondary" type="button" id="btnVerifyDduClean" onclick="verifyDduCleanManual()" style="display:none;margin-top:8px;">Vérifier nettoyage</button>
        <div id="dduAutoVendorPick" style="display:none;margin-top:10px;">
          <label class="card-desc" for="dduAutoVendorSelect">Fabricant GPU :</label>
          <select id="dduAutoVendorSelect" style="margin-left:8px;"></select>
          <button class="btn secondary" type="button" style="margin-left:8px;" onclick="dduAutoCleanAfterVendorPick()">Lancer le nettoyage</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <strong>Installation nouveau pilote graphique</strong>
        <div class="grid2" style="margin-top:8px;">
          <div class="panel"><h3>GPU détecté</h3><div class="row"><div class="v" id="nvGpuDetected"></div></div></div>
          <div class="panel"><h3>Pilote installé</h3><div class="row"><div class="v" id="nvDriverInstalled"></div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div id="nvGpuManualPick" style="display:none;margin-top:12px;">
          <p class="card-desc" style="font-size:12px;">Impossible de détecter automatiquement le GPU. Choisis le fabricant :</p>
          <select id="nvGpuManualVendorSelect" style="margin-top:6px;">
            <option value="NVIDIA">NVIDIA</option>
            <option value="AMD">AMD</option>
            <option value="INTEL">Intel</option>
          </select>
          <button class="btn secondary" type="button" style="margin-left:8px;margin-top:6px;" onclick="confirmNvGpuManualVendorForInstall()">Confirmer et installer</button>
        </div>
        <div class="nv-driver-upd nv-driver-upd--neutral" id="nvDriverUpdatePanel">
          <div class="nv-driver-upd__lines">
            <div id="nvDriverStateLine" class="ui-debug-only" aria-hidden="true">état du pilote : -</div>
            <div id="nvDriverUpdateInstalledLine" style="display:none;">Pilote installé : -</div>
            <div id="nvDriverUpdateLatestLine">Dernière version disponible : -</div>
          </div>
          <div class="nv-driver-upd__status" id="nvDriverUpdateStatusText"></div>
          <div class="nv-driver-upd__detail ui-debug-only" id="nvDriverUpdateDetail" style="display:none;" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="nv-driver-upd nv-driver-upd--neutral ui-debug-only" id="nvPresetPanel" style="display:none;" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="nv-driver-upd__head">
            <span class="nv-driver-upd__title">Preset NVCleanInstall Unreal</span>
          </div>
          <div class="nv-driver-upd__lines">
            <div style="margin-bottom:8px;">
              <span class="tcp-badge tcp-badge--ok" id="nvPresetStatusBadge">Preset : </span>
              <span class="tcp-badge tcp-badge--progress" id="nvPresetNvcBadge" style="margin-left:8px;">NVCleanInstall : </span>
            </div>
            <div id="nvPresetNvcPath" style="font-size:11px;color:#94a3b8;word-break:break-all;"></div>
            <div id="nvPresetMethodLine">Méthode : -</div>
            <div id="nvPresetDriverLine">Dernier pilote : -</div>
            <div id="nvPresetLastAppliedLine">Dernière application du preset : -</div>
          </div>
          <div class="toolbar" style="margin-top:10px;">
            <button class="btn secondary" type="button" onclick="showUnrealNvidiaPresetChecklist()">Voir la checklist</button>
            <button class="btn secondary" type="button" onclick="openNvcleanstallWithPresetGuidance()">Ouvrir NVCleanInstall (preset)</button>
          </div>
          <div class="logs ui-debug-only" id="nvPresetLogBox" style="margin-top:12px;max-height:160px;display:none;" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tcp-badge tcp-badge--progress" id="nvcleanstallOpenStatus" style="margin-top:12px;display:none;"></div>
        <div class="nv-opt-progress-wrap drivers-progress-wrap" id="nvMediaProgressWrap" style="display:none;">
          <div class="nv-opt-progress-bar">
            <div class="nv-opt-progress-fill" id="nvMediaProgressFill" style="width:0%;"></div>
            <span class="nv-opt-progress-text" id="nvMediaProgressText">0 %</span>
          </div>
          <div class="nv-opt-progress-step" id="nvMediaProgressStep">0tape en cours : En attente</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tcp-badge tcp-badge--progress" id="nvMediaAutoStatus" style="margin-top:12px;display:none;"></div>
        <div id="nvcleanAutoStatus" class="tool-status tool-status--info" style="display:none;margin-top:10px;"></div>
        <div class="toolbar" style="margin-top:14px;">
          <button class="btn secondary" type="button" onclick="openNvcleanstall()">Ouvrir NVCleanInstall</button>
          <button class="btn btn-primary" type="button" id="btnNvcleaninstallAuto" onclick="launchNvcleaninstallAutoExperimental()">Installer automatiquement le dernier pilote</button>
          <button class="btn secondary" type="button" id="btnVerifyNvidiaInstall" onclick="verifyNvidiaInstallAfterManualConfirmation()" style="display:none;">Vérifier l'installation</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card nv-gaming-card">
        <strong>Optimisation NVIDIA</strong>
        <span class="nv-gaming-card-desc">Panneau de configuration, faible latence et maximum de FPS</span>
        <div class="toolbar nv-gaming-actions">
          <button class="btn btn-primary btn-nv-gaming-main" type="button" id="btnApplyNvidiaGaming" onclick="applyNvidiaGamingOptimizationFromUi()">Appliquer optimisation NVIDIA complète</button>
          <button class="btn secondary btn-nv-reset-panel" type="button" id="btnResetNvPanel" onclick="resetNvidiaPanelFromDriversUi()">Reset panneau NVIDIA</button>
        </div>
        <div class="nv-opt-progress-wrap" id="nvOptProgressWrap" style="display:none;">
          <div class="nv-opt-progress-bar">
            <div class="nv-opt-progress-fill" id="nvOptProgressFill" style="width:0%;"></div>
            <span class="nv-opt-progress-text" id="nvOptProgressText">0 %</span>
          </div>
          <div class="nv-opt-progress-step" id="nvOptProgressStep">0tape en cours : En attente</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tcp-badge tcp-badge--progress" id="nvidiaGamingStatus" style="margin-top:12px;">Prêt</div>
        <div id="nvidiaGamingSteps" class="nv-gaming-steps" style="margin-top:10px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:#ddd6fe;display:none;"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div></div>
</div>

<div id="page-conn" class="page">
  <h2 class="page-title">Connexion</h2>
  <p class="lead">Optimisez votre connexion pour le jeu : profil gaming, restauration et TCP Optimizer.</p>
  <div id="connAdminBanner" class="conn-admin-banner ui-debug-only" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="neon-panel" style="margin-top:14px;"><div class="neon-inner">
    <div class="kicker">Profils réseau rapides</div>
    <p class="lead" style="margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:0;font-size:13px;">Profils réseau rapides pour le jeu ou le téléchargement. Une confirmation Windows peut être demandée.</p>
    <div class="cards" style="margin-top:14px;">
      <div class="card conn-profile-card conn-profile-card--selected" id="connProfileGaming" onclick="setConnProfileSelection('gaming')">
        <span class="conn-profile-badge">Sélectionné</span>
        <strong>Profil Gaming</strong>
        <p class="conn-quick-desc">Optimise la connexion pour le jeu.</p>
        <div class="toolbar" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <button class="btn" type="button" onclick="launchQuickNetProfile('gaming')">Lancer Gaming</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card conn-profile-card" id="connProfileDownload" onclick="setConnProfileSelection('download')">
        <span class="conn-profile-badge">Sélectionné</span>
        <strong>Profil Download</strong>
        <p class="conn-quick-desc">Remet le profil réseau adapté au téléchargement / usage normal.</p>
        <div class="toolbar" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <button class="btn" type="button" onclick="launchQuickNetProfile('download')">Lancer Download</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div></div>
  <div class="neon-panel tcp-card"><div class="neon-inner">
    <div class="kicker">TCP / Réseau</div>
    <div class="tcp-hero-title">TCP Optimizer 4</div>
    <div class="tcp-hero-sub">Optimisation du réseau</div>
    <div class="tcp-badge" id="connOptimizeStatus">Non optimisé</div>
    <p class="conn-quick-desc" id="connOptimizeLast" style="margin-top:8px;">Dernière optimisation : -</p>
    <div class="toolbar">
      <button class="btn" type="button" onclick="launchTcpOptimizer()">Lancer Optimizer</button>
      <button class="btn" type="button" onclick="restoreTcpNetworkWindowsDefaults()">Restaurer réglage réseau</button>
      <button class="btn" type="button" onclick="applyTcpOptimizerGamingProfile()">Appliquer profil gaming</button>
    </div>
  </div></div>
</div>

<div id="page-game" class="page">
  <h2 class="page-title">Jeu</h2>
  <p class="lead">Profils par titre et réglages compétitifs   contenu à venir.</p>
  <div class="neon-panel" style="margin-top:14px;"><div class="neon-inner">
    <div class="kicker">Profils</div>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <strong>Fichiers Warzone</strong>
        <div class="tcp-badge tcp-badge--bad" id="warzoneInstallStatus">Fichiers Warzone non détectés</div>
        <span class="card-desc">Installe automatiquement les fichiers Warzone dans le dossier players avec sauvegarde .bak.</span>
        <div class="toolbar" style="margin-top:12px;">
          <button class="btn btn-primary" type="button" onclick="installWarzoneFiles()">Installer les fichiers Warzone</button>
        </div>
        <div class="logs" id="warzoneLogBox" style="margin-top:14px;max-height:220px;"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card"><strong>Fortnite</strong><span class="card-desc">Bientôt disponible</span></div>
      <div class="card"><strong>Apex</strong><span class="card-desc">Bientôt disponible</span></div>
      <div class="card"><strong>Profils personnalisés</strong><span class="card-desc">Bientôt disponible</span></div>
    </div>
  </div></div>
</div>

<div id="page-opt" class="page">
  <h2 class="page-title">Optimisation</h2>
  <p class="lead">Sélectionnez les optimisations souhaitées, puis cliquez sur Appliquer. L'état affiché est mémorisé par l'application.</p>
  <div class="neon-panel" style="margin-top:14px;"><div class="neon-inner">
    <div class="kicker">Modules</div>
    <div id="optRunnerStatus" class="opt-runner-status opt-runner-status--muted" aria-live="polite"></div>
    <div id="optOptimizationGrid" class="opt-grid" role="list">
      <div class="opt-card" id="opt-card-debloat" data-opt-id="debloat">
        <div class="opt-card__head">
          <div><div class="opt-card__title">Debloat</div></div>
          <button type="button" class="opt-toggle" id="opt-toggle-debloat" aria-label="Debloat"><span class="opt-toggle__thumb"></span></button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="opt-card" id="opt-card-mode-jeu" data-opt-id="mode-jeu">
        <div class="opt-card__head">
          <div><div class="opt-card__title">Mode Jeu</div></div>
          <button type="button" class="opt-toggle" id="opt-toggle-mode-jeu" aria-label="Mode Jeu"><span class="opt-toggle__thumb"></span></button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="opt-card" id="opt-card-gestion-alimentation" data-opt-id="gestion-alimentation">
        <div class="opt-card__head">
          <div><div class="opt-card__title">Gestion de l'alimentation</div></div>
          <button type="button" class="opt-toggle" id="opt-toggle-gestion-alimentation" aria-label="Gestion de l'alimentation"><span class="opt-toggle__thumb"></span></button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="opt-card opt-card--placeholder" id="opt-card-empty-4"></div>
      <div class="opt-card opt-card--placeholder" id="opt-card-empty-5"></div>
      <div class="opt-card opt-card--placeholder" id="opt-card-empty-6"></div>
      <div class="opt-card opt-card--placeholder" id="opt-card-empty-7"></div>
      <div class="opt-card opt-card--placeholder" id="opt-card-empty-8"></div>
      <div class="opt-card opt-card--placeholder" id="opt-card-empty-9"></div>
      <div class="opt-card opt-card--placeholder" id="opt-card-empty-10"></div>
      <div class="opt-card opt-card--placeholder" id="opt-card-empty-11"></div>
      <div class="opt-card opt-card--placeholder" id="opt-card-empty-12"></div>
      <div class="opt-card opt-card--placeholder" id="opt-card-empty-13"></div>
      <div class="opt-card opt-card--placeholder" id="opt-card-empty-14"></div>
      <div class="opt-card opt-card--placeholder" id="opt-card-empty-15"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="opt-actions">
      <button class="btn btn-primary" type="button" id="btnOptimizationApply" onclick="applyOptimizationChanges()">Appliquer</button>
    </div>
    <div class="opt-progress-wrap" id="optProgressWrap">
      <div class="opt-progress-bar">
        <div class="opt-progress-fill" id="optProgressFill" style="width:0%;"></div>
        <span class="opt-progress-text" id="optProgressText">0 %</span>
      </div>
      <div class="opt-progress-step" id="optProgressStep"></div>
    </div>
  </div></div>
</div>

<div id="page-sound" class="page">
  <h2 class="page-title">Son</h2>
  <p class="lead">Chaîne audio, Discord et périphériques   contenu à venir.</p>
  <div class="neon-panel" style="margin-top:14px;"><div class="neon-inner">
    <div class="kicker">Audio</div>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card"><strong>VoiceMeeter</strong><span class="card-desc">Bientôt disponible</span></div>
      <div class="card"><strong>Discord</strong><span class="card-desc">Bientôt disponible</span></div>
      <div class="card"><strong>Périphérique audio</strong><span class="card-desc">Bientôt disponible</span></div>
      <div class="card"><strong>Optimisation Warzone audio</strong><span class="card-desc">Bientôt disponible</span></div>
    </div>
  </div></div>
</div>

<div id="page-account" class="page">
  <h2 class="page-title">Compte / Abonnement</h2>
  <p class="lead">Connexion démo : session locale, aucun serveur réel.</p>
  <div class="neon-panel" style="margin-top:14px;"><div class="neon-inner">
    <div class="kicker">Identifiants</div>
    <div class="account-form">
      <label for="inEmail">Email</label>
      <input id="inEmail" class="input-wide" />
      <label for="inPassword">Mot de passe</label>
      <input id="inPassword" class="input-wide" type="password" />
      <div class="toolbar">
        <button class="btn" type="button" onclick="loginMock()">Connexion</button>
        <button class="btn secondary" type="button" onclick="registerMock()">Créer un compte</button>
        <button class="btn secondary" type="button" onclick="logoutMock()">Se déconnecter</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div></div>
  <div class="neon-panel" style="margin-top:14px;"><div class="neon-inner">
    <div class="kicker">Résumé</div>
    <div class="grid2">
      <div class="panel"><h3>Abonnement</h3><div class="row"><div class="l">Statut</div><div class="v" id="subStatus">Inactif</div></div></div>
      <div class="panel"><h3>Session</h3><div class="row"><div class="l">Email</div><div class="v" id="sessEmail">Non connecté</div></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="toolbar" style="margin-top:16px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid rgba(167,139,250,.22);">
      <button class="btn secondary" type="button" disabled>Gérer mon abonnement</button>
    </div>
  </div></div>
</div>

<div id="page-settings" class="page">
  <h2 class="page-title">Paramètres</h2>
  <p class="lead">Interface, informations applicatives et dossiers.</p>
  <div class="neon-panel" style="margin-top:14px;"><div class="neon-inner">
    <div class="kicker">Interface</div>
    <div class="option-tile">
      <div class="option-tile-text">
        <span class="option-tile-title">Interrupteur (aperçu)</span>
        <span class="option-tile-desc">Style type optimisation PC   aucune action liée, réservé pour de futurs réglages.</span>
      </div>
      <label class="unreal-switch" title="Exemple visuel">
        <input type="checkbox" id="uiDemoSwitch" />
        <span class="unreal-switch-track"><span class="unreal-switch-thumb"></span></span>
      </label>
    </div>
  </div></div>
  <div class="neon-panel" style="margin-top:14px;"><div class="neon-inner">
    <div class="kicker">Informations</div>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card"><strong>Thème</strong><span class="card-desc" id="setTheme">-</span></div>
      <div class="card"><strong>Langue</strong><span class="card-desc" id="setLang">-</span></div>
      <div class="card"><strong>Dossier logs</strong><span class="card-desc" id="setLogsDir">-</span></div>
      <div class="card"><strong>Version</strong><span class="card-desc" id="setVersion">-</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="toolbar">
      <button class="btn" type="button" onclick="exportLogsUi()">Exporter logs</button>
      <button class="btn secondary" type="button" onclick="openUnrealFolder()">Ouvrir dossier Unreal</button>
    </div>
  </div></div>
  <div class="neon-panel" style="margin-top:14px;"><div class="neon-inner">
    <div class="kicker">Mise à jour</div>
    <p class="lead" style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:13px;opacity:.85;">Dépôt officiel : <a href="https://github.com/SanaaCOD/PurpleBoost" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com/SanaaCOD/PurpleBoost</a></p>
    <div class="pb-update-version-row cards">
      <div class="card"><strong>Version actuelle</strong><span class="card-desc" id="pbUpdateLocalVersion">v1.0.0</span></div>
      <div class="card"><strong>Dernière version disponible</strong><span class="card-desc" id="pbUpdateLatestVersion">—</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="toolbar" style="margin:0;">
      <button class="btn" type="button" id="pbBtnCheckUpdate" onclick="pbCheckForUpdates()">Vérifier les mises à jour</button>
    </div>
    <div id="pbUpdateActions" class="pb-update-actions">
      <button class="btn secondary" type="button" id="pbBtnUpdateDownload" onclick="pbUpdateDownload()">Télécharger</button>
      <button class="btn" type="button" id="pbBtnUpdateInstall" onclick="pbUpdateInstallNow()">Installer maintenant</button>
    </div>
    <p id="pbUpdateStatus" class="pb-update-status muted" style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:12px;min-height:1.2em;"></p>
  </div></div>
</div>

</div>
<div class="logs" id="logBox"></div>
</section>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div id="pbAuthGate" class="pb-auth-gate" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="pb-auth-window-controls">
    <button type="button" class="pb-auth-win-btn" title="Réduire" onclick="unrealTitlebarMinimize()">&#8722;</button>
    <button type="button" class="pb-auth-win-btn" title="Fermer" onclick="unrealTitlebarClose()">&#10005;</button>
  </div>
  <table class="pb-overlay-table" role="presentation"><tr><td>
    <div class="pb-auth-shell">
      <div class="pb-auth-hero">
        <div class="pb-auth-logo-box">
          <img id="pbAuthLogoImg" src="assets/images/unreal-logo.png" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none';try{document.getElementById('pbAuthLogoFallback').style.display='block';}catch(e){}" />
          <svg id="pbAuthLogoFallback" class="pb-auth-logo-fallback" viewBox="0 0 100 118" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="10" d="M 8 58 L 20 46 L 20 90 L 50 112 L 80 86 L 80 40 L 94 26"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h1 class="pb-auth-brand">PurpleBoost</h1>
        <p class="pb-auth-tagline">Optimisation PC pour le gaming compétitif</p>
      </div>
      <div id="pbAuthMessage" class="pb-auth-msg" role="status"></div>

      <div id="pbAuthView-welcome" class="pb-auth-view active">
        <div class="pb-auth-panel">
          <p class="pb-auth-panel-title">Bienvenue</p>
          <p class="pb-auth-panel-lead">Connectez-vous ou créez un compte pour continuer.</p>
          <div class="pb-auth-actions">
            <button type="button" class="pb-auth-btn" onclick="pbShowAuthView('login')">Se connecter</button>
            <button type="button" class="pb-auth-btn pb-auth-btn--ghost" onclick="pbShowAuthView('register')">Créer un compte</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="pbAuthView-login" class="pb-auth-view">
        <div class="pb-auth-panel">
          <p class="pb-auth-panel-title">Connexion</p>
          <p class="pb-auth-panel-lead">Connectez-vous pour accéder à vos optimisations.</p>
          <label class="pb-auth-label" for="pbAuthLoginEmail">E-mail</label>
          <input id="pbAuthLoginEmail" class="pb-auth-input" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="vous@exemple.com" />
          <label class="pb-auth-label" for="pbAuthLoginPassword">Mot de passe</label>
          <input id="pbAuthLoginPassword" class="pb-auth-input" type="password" placeholder="Votre mot de passe" />
          <div class="pb-auth-actions">
            <button type="button" class="pb-auth-btn" onclick="pbLoginAccount()">Connexion</button>
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="pb-auth-link" onclick="pbShowAuthView('register')">Pas de compte ? Créer un compte</button>
          <button type="button" class="pb-auth-link" onclick="pbShowAuthView('welcome')">Retour</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="pbAuthView-register" class="pb-auth-view">
        <div class="pb-auth-panel">
          <p class="pb-auth-panel-title">Créer un compte</p>
          <p class="pb-auth-panel-lead">Inscription locale — vos données restent sur ce PC.</p>
          <label class="pb-auth-label" for="pbAuthRegEmail">E-mail</label>
          <input id="pbAuthRegEmail" class="pb-auth-input" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="vous@exemple.com" />
          <label class="pb-auth-label" for="pbAuthRegPassword">Mot de passe</label>
          <input id="pbAuthRegPassword" class="pb-auth-input" type="password" placeholder="6 caractères minimum" />
          <label class="pb-auth-label" for="pbAuthRegConfirm">Confirmer le mot de passe</label>
          <input id="pbAuthRegConfirm" class="pb-auth-input" type="password" placeholder="Répétez le mot de passe" />
          <div class="pb-auth-actions">
            <button type="button" class="pb-auth-btn" onclick="pbRegisterAccount()">Créer le compte</button>
          </div>
          <button type="button" class="pb-auth-link" onclick="pbShowAuthView('login')">Déjà un compte ? Se connecter</button>
          <button type="button" class="pb-auth-link" onclick="pbShowAuthView('welcome')">Retour</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </td></tr></table>
</div>

<div id="pbLoadingScreen" class="pb-loading-gate" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="pb-auth-window-controls">
    <button type="button" class="pb-auth-win-btn" title="Réduire" onclick="unrealTitlebarMinimize()">&#8722;</button>
    <button type="button" class="pb-auth-win-btn" title="Fermer" onclick="unrealTitlebarClose()">&#10005;</button>
  </div>
  <table class="pb-overlay-table" role="presentation"><tr><td>
    <div class="pb-loading-inner">
      <div class="pb-loading-logo-wrap">
        <img id="pbLoadingLogoImg" class="pb-loading-logo-img" src="assets/images/unreal-logo.png" alt="" style="display:none" onerror="this.style.display='none';try{document.getElementById('pbLoadingLogoSvg').style.display='block';}catch(e){}" />
        <svg id="pbLoadingLogoSvg" class="pb-loading-logo-svg" viewBox="0 0 100 118" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="pbLoadUbl" x1="0" y1="118" x2="100" y2="0" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#22d3ee"/><stop offset="34%" stop-color="#4338ca"/><stop offset="66%" stop-color="#a855f7"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#fb7185"/></linearGradient></defs><path fill="none" stroke="#f8f7ff" stroke-width="13" stroke-linejoin="miter" stroke-miterlimit="6" d="M 8 58 L 20 46 L 20 90 L 50 112 L 80 86 L 80 40 L 94 26"/><path fill="none" stroke="url(#pbLoadUbl)" stroke-width="8" stroke-linejoin="miter" stroke-miterlimit="6" d="M 8 58 L 20 46 L 20 90 L 50 112 L 80 86 L 80 40 L 94 26"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="pb-loading-ring" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="pb-loading-text">Chargement de Unreal Optimization...</div>
    </div>
  </td></tr></table>
</div>

</body>
</html>
